omatic track crystallized with Ukraine snubbing Lukashenko and engaging Tsikhanouskaya as Kyiv's legitimate interlocutor on Belarus. Rubio's concurrent US troop reduction announcement at Helsingborg creates a compounding adverse structural signal for alliance architecture. Domestically, the week is quieter post-Yermak, with civil society mobilizing against premature legal death declarations for 90,000+ missing soldiers — a new governance-military interface issue with long-term veteran-politics implications.",
